('cmtjjio6h000jz0jz5e2p2hmy', 'cmtjisk5f004a13z8rn07l7dg', 'cmtgl47d40012y5ui7myntm02', 1, '- **BAPPEBTI** (Badan Pengawas Perdagangan Berjangka Komoditi, saat ini bagian dari Kementerian Perdagangan) — pengawas utama untuk kegiatan pialang berjangka komoditi.\n- **Bursa & Kliring** (PT Bursa Berjangka Jakarta / BBJ dan PT Kliring Berjangka Indonesia / KBI) — penyelenggara perdagangan dan penjaminan transaksi di bursa berjangka.\n- **OJK** (Otoritas Jasa Keuangan) — relevan untuk kegiatan sebagai perantara perdagangan efek derivatif keuangan.\n- **Bank Indonesia** — relevan untuk keikutsertaan dalam sistem perdagangan alternatif derivatif (PUVA/DNDF terkait valuta asing).\n\n## 2. Tabel Legalitas & Perizinan', 155, '[-0.041717529296875, 0.0189971923828125, 0.062286376953125, 0.030181884765625, -0.0113677978515625, 0.01751708984375, -0.01861572265625, 0.0247344970703125, 0.056427001953125, -0.0222015380859375, 0.03448486328125, -0.034027099609375, -0.01064300537109375, -0.01117706298828125, 0.0165863037109375, 0.01465606689453125, -0.0214385986328125, 0.06268310546875, -0.004924774169921875, -0.00258636474609375, 0.01953125, -0.0005035400390625, -0.0292205810546875, 0.003709793090820312, 0.000701904296875, -0.05303955078125, -0.0399169921875, 0.0039215087890625, 0.0088043212890625, -0.003732681274414062, 0.0811767578125, -0.031890869140625, 0.002349853515625, -0.0069122314453125, 0.0045928955078125, -0.0166015625, -0.001542091369628906, 0.00569915771484375, 0.0289154052734375, -0.01416778564453125, 0.00432586669921875, -0.054901123046875, -0.01450347900390625, -0.024169921875, -0.00969696044921875, 0.0301971435546875, -0.025054931640625, -0.06658935546875, 0.013671875, 0.01476287841796875, -0.007015228271484375, 0.027374267578125, 0.05120849609375, 0.03436279296875, 0.00467681884765625, 0.0416259765625, -0.00888824462890625, 0.025238037109375, 0.050506591796875, -0.044921875, -0.034423828125, 0.024749755859375, -0.0421142578125, 0.01093292236328125, -0.02920532226562