('cmtjjiq6p0031z0jzv4kp58mh', 'cmtjirxwz003m13z833y4n4gz', 'cmtgl47d40012y5ui7myntm02', 2, '---\n\n## 1. Peta Keterhubungan Dokumen KB (dipindahkan dari 00_INDEX_Peta_Dokumen_KB.md)\n\n```\nSystem_Prompt_Solid_Prime_AI            ← SUMBER TUNGGAL aturan & script jawaban bot\n│\nSOLID_GOLD_BERJANGKA_MASTER_KB_v1_8_1   ← HUB FAKTA (identitas perusahaan, rujukan resmi, produk & akun)\n│\n├── KB_Tambahan_Legalitas_Perizinan_v1        → fakta nomor izin & lembaga pengawas\n├── KB_Tambahan_Akun_Reguler_v1_8             → fakta spesifikasi produk Multilateral & Bilateral\n└── KB_Tambahan_Biaya_Swap_Margin_v1_2_1      → fakta biaya/margin/storage fee Akun Mini\n       │\n       ├── Trade_Table_Spesifikasi_Kontrak_Mini_Account_Feb2026        → sumber data resmi angka Akun Mini\n       └── Trading_Rules_CDD_Sederhana_0_1_Lot_Mini_Account_Feb2026    → aturan operasional resmi Akun Mini\n\nDokumen ini (INTERNAL_Catatan_Compliance_BD) menampung status validasi & catatan kerja\nuntuk seluruh dokumen fakta di atas — tidak masuk grafik evidence chatbot.\n```', 237, '[-0.001183509826660156, 0.02410888671875, 0.042816162109375, 0.01506805419921875, 0.007175445556640625, 0.008392333984375, -0.02325439453125, 0.06512451171875, 0.0129547119140625, -0.035125732421875, 0.0380859375, -0.026641845703125, 0.004634857177734375, -0.016326904296875, 0.041839599609375, 0.045013427734375, -0.02447509765625, 0.0279083251953125, -0.036285400390625, -0.004840850830078125, 0.0221405029296875, 0.005619049072265625, 0.015350341796875, 0.0087890625, 0.021514892578125, -0.06768798828125, -0.061798095703125, -0.055267333984375, 0.0157318115234375, -0.053802490234375, 0.01383209228515625, -0.0450439453125, -0.0244293212890625, -0.006744384765625, -0.0263519287109375, 0.0408935546875, 0.0093231201171875, 0.0152587890625, 0.019775390625, -0.0154571533203125, -0.0082244873046875, -0.07025146484375, -0.0190277099609375, 0.0330810546875, -0.00809478759765625, 0.0175933837890625, -0.02679443359375, -0.0160217285